CockroachDB's logic tests

The scripts in this directory are files of CockroachDB's
pkg/sql/logictest/testdata/logic_test/ at tag v23.2.0, commit
8f14432835d667982828b5319cfd130991fbf80c (https://github.com/cockroachdb/cockroach),
Copyright The Cockroach Authors; CockroachDB 23.2 is (c) 2023 Cockroach Labs, Inc.
Each is as it is there but for its header and the condition lines added before
its records, `skipif transformer <id>` and `onlyif cockroachdb # ...`, and the
twins after some of them.

